### Step 3: Update the `bellTooltip` getter

Find your existing `bellTooltip` getter and replace it with:

```typescript

get bellTooltip(): string {
  if (!this.enableBellIcon()) {
    return this.ALERTS_UNAVAILABLE_TOOLTIP;
  }

  if (this.notificationResource?.length) {
    const recipients = this.notificationResource
      .map(item =>
        this.phoneFormat.transform(item['communicationValue'])
      )
      .join('\n');

    return `(${this.notificationResource.length}) Alert Recipients\n${recipients}`;
  }

  return ACTIONS_SIDEBAR_MENU.ALERT_NOTIFY;
}
```

What this changes:

* When alerts are unavailable, the new tooltip is returned immediately.

* When alerts are available and recipients exist, the existing formatted recipient list remains unchanged.

* When alerts are available but no recipients exist, the existing manage-alerts tooltip remains unchanged.

