This preserves your existing subscribed/unsubscribed icons for eligible shipments while adding the unavailable state.

### Why the wrapper is needed

Angular Material tooltips may not trigger on disabled buttons. Putting the tooltip on the surrounding `span` lets users hover over the disabled bell and see the reason.

The wrapper must receive pointer events. If your component styles interfere with that, adjust the wrapper's CSS as described in Step 5.

